This licence covers the app's code (index.html, css/, js/, sw.js, manifest.webmanifest) and the
festival icons in icons/, which are Karthik Raman's own work.

- data/ is generated with jyotisha and adyatithi (both MIT). Festival descriptions and verses
  come from the adyatithi rule files; the pañcāṅga-paṭhanam ślokas are from Śānti Kusumākara.
- fonts/ carry their own licences, listed in fonts/README.md: the SIL Open Font License for
  most, and CC BY-NC-ND 3.0 for Siddhanta, which is included unmodified.
